cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Funnel-Stage SHAP: a design science framework for stage-conditioned
  explainable purchase prediction in e-commerce
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite the accompanying
  manuscript. The DOI below is a placeholder until the repository is deposited.
