    # orcid: https://orcid.org/[DATA REQUIRED]
repository-code: '[DATA REQUIRED: repository URL]'
abstract: >-
  Prediction and explanation are held to the same temporal constraint: at each
  funnel stage a model is fitted on the event prefix observable at that stage's
  cut-point, Shapley attributions are computed from exactly that prefix, and a
  validation layer tests their faithfulness, stability and reproducibility.
keywords:
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP
  - purchase prediction
  - customer journey
  - clickstream
  - decision support
  - design science
